f=\"/wiki/Caretaker%27s_Care\" title=\"Caretaker's Care\">Caretaker's Care</a></dt><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(surface)\" title=\"Acid (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acidic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(surface)\" title=\"Acid (surface)\">Acidic</a> surfaces don't affect you, and you are <a href=\"/wiki/Resistant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistant\">Resistant</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </sp